  "releaseNotes": "Source-editing fixes: edits keep the source layout around directives, multi-line chains, lambdas, interpolated strings, type headers and brace-less statements; no edit re-binds a dangling else; container and document comments keep their owner. Await in async contexts, constraint edits, invalid embedded statements (CS1023) and leaked internal exceptions are fixed. Remaining known limitations are listed in the README.",
